&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Coursera + Udemy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Coursera and Udemy are now one company, bringing together two mission-driven brands to create the world’s most powerful platform for turning learning into progress. Together, we help more than 300 million learners and 12,000+ enterprise customers build the skills they need for a world being reshaped by AI. Read more about the combined company by visiting our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://blog.coursera.org/coursera-and-udemy-are-now-one-company-creating-the-worlds-most-comprehensive-skills-platform/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;blog&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why join us now?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;AI is transforming how people learn, work, and grow, and the need for new skills has never been greater. Coursera brings trusted content and credentials from leading university and industry partners, while Udemy brings a dynamic skills marketplace and global network of real-world experts. By combining these strengths, we can connect more people and organizations to the skills they need, when they need them.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shape what comes next&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By joining our team, you’ll have the opportunity to reshape how the world learns and applies skills—and help millions of people participate in the new economy. Bring your ideas, expertise, and perspective to meaningful work that can make a difference at global scale.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About this role&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll help build and engage Coursera&#39;s global learner community across organic social channels, sitting at the intersection of social strategy, audience engagement, learner advocacy, and brand storytelling. Rather than managing reactions alone, you&#39;ll develop proactive engagement approaches that increase Coursera&#39;s visibility, strengthen learner relationships, and surface insights that inform social content and broader marketing strategy. You&#39;ll partner closely with Social, Brand, Content, Learner Support, PR/Comms, and external agency partners to ensure Coursera shows up with a timely, thoughtful, and learner-centered voice. You&#39;ll also identify learners with compelling stories, build a pipeline for follow-up, and help translate community conversations into content opportunities, testimonials, and strategic insights.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About your skills&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Social Media Management&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Core skill for managing community voice, engagement, and interactions across Coursera&#39;s organic social platforms daily.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Social Listening&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Critical for identifying community trends, learner sentiment shifts, and emerging platform behaviors to inform strategy.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Community Outreach&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vital for building learner story pipeline, identifying compelling outcomes, and conducting thoughtful learner outreach.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll be doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute proactive community engagement strategies across Coursera&#39;s organic social channels, including LinkedIn, Instagram, Threads, TikTok, YouTube, Facebook, X, and emerging community surfaces like Reddit to grow brand visibility and deepen learner connection&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage Coursera&#39;s community voice across social platforms by responding to high-priority learner comments, mentions, repost opportunities, and engagement moments, while coordinating with agency support for general comment response&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify community trends, learner needs, sentiment shifts, and emerging platform behaviors, then translate findings into actionable recommendations for social content, campaigns, and audience engagement strategy&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain a learner story pipeline by identifying learners with compelling outcomes or experiences, conducting thoughtful outreach, and coordinating follow-up with relevant internal partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Learner Support, Social, Brand, Content, PR/Comms, Legal, and agency teams to escalate sensitive issues, align on messaging, and ensure community interactions reflect Coursera&#39;s brand and values&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track and report on community engagement, proactive outreach, learner story sourcing, sentiment, and recurring themes to measure impact and inform ongoing strategy&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in community management across major social platforms such as LinkedIn, Instagram, TikTok, YouTube, Facebook, Threads, Reddit, or X&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using social media management, social listening, or reporting tools to monitor engagement, sentiment, and audience trends, and to source customer stories for marketing purposes&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building proactive community engagement programs that go beyond inbound response management&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience navigating sensitive customer or community issues with sound judgment, empathy, and clear escalation practices&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This role is available in the following US Pay Zones:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;US Zone 3: $121,550 - $143,000&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;US Zone 4: $113,050- $133,000&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Coursera + Udemy, we offer competitive, zone-based pay aligned to your location, experience, and role level across four U.S. pay zones. Our total rewards package goes beyond salary, with comprehensive health and wellness benefits, bonus and RSU equity programs, and global perks designed to help you grow and thrive wherever you are.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;US Pay Zones&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;US-Z1: Bay Area&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;US-Z2: NYC and Seattle Metro&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;US-Z3: CA, WA, NY, NJ, CO, CT, DC, GA, IL, MA, MD, OR, RI, TX, VA&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;US-Z4: AK, AZ, DE, FL, HI, ID, IN, IA, KS, KY, MI, MN, MO, MT, NC, NV, NH, OH, OK, PA, SC, TN, UT, VT, WI&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Posting Date:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;September 23, 2026&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Application Window:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;We anticipate the application window will be open until 10/9/2026. Based on business needs, this opportunity may remain posted beyond or closed before the anticipated application window.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h6&gt;&lt;strong&gt;#LI-JC2&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h6&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;For more information about how Coursera collects and uses your personal information, please see our &lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://files.clinchtalent.com/1d7f2c0f91ebf75d580f56447fa54859/2acb24eb91f1e23b90ac9e9285de5aaf/Coursera%20and%20Udemy%20Global%20Applicant%20Privacy%20Notice.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Coursera + Udemy Global Applicant Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;u&gt;.&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To protect against recruitment fraud, Coursera + Udemy recruiters only communicate via official coursera.org/udemy.com email addresses and never through personal accounts. We do not accept resumes via email or social media; please submit all applications directly through our careers page.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you encounter suspicious recruitment activity, please report it via our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://forms.gle/Mb8UktwuaJAukb3H7&quot;&gt;Fraudulent Activity Submission Form.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Coursera is an Equal Opportunity Employer committed to building a welcoming and inclusive workplace. We consider all qualified applicants without regard to legally protected characteristics and provide reasonable accommodations upon request at recruiting@coursera.org.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
